OL,3,ANI secretary to hold Stormont talks
OL,4,Aover budget deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Secretary of State, Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant, has arrived at Stormont Castle
OL,8,Fahead of talks with Northern Ireland's
OL,9,Fpolitical parties in a bid to break the
OL,10,Fdeadlock on the budget.
OL,12,FThe executive has said it cannot agree
OL,13,Fa budget for this financial year
OL,14,Fwithout additional support from the
OL,15,FWestminster government.
OL,17,FFollowing the passing of a deadline in
OL,18,FAugust, Stormont officials were given
OL,19,Flegal powers to spend up to 95% of last
OL,20,Fyear's funding in the absence of
OL,21,Fministers agreeing the budget.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
